WEBVTT

01:41.840 --> 01:43.120
Dad!

01:43.200 --> 01:44.640
Dad!

01:44.720 --> 01:46.520
Dad!

02:06.040 --> 02:07.640
Give my daughter back.

02:09.160 --> 02:10.199
Or…

02:10.720 --> 02:12.360
I won't leave,

02:12.880 --> 02:14.480
even if you run me over a thousand times.

02:15.360 --> 02:17.080
Don't chicken out.

02:17.160 --> 02:18.560
Floor it!

02:18.640 --> 02:20.200
Run him over!

02:20.280 --> 02:21.280
Dad!

02:21.360 --> 02:23.080
Don't hit my dad!

02:25.960 --> 02:27.080
Dad!

02:31.960 --> 02:33.280
Dad!

02:35.120 --> 02:36.960
Give my daughter…

02:37.040 --> 02:38.280
back.

02:41.960 --> 02:43.320
Turn around. Run.

02:52.240 --> 02:54.360
That's what you get
for running over my dad!

02:54.440 --> 02:55.280
How can you run over my dad!

02:55.360 --> 02:56.680
Sir!

02:56.760 --> 02:59.480
That's what you get
for running over my dad!

02:59.560 --> 03:01.280
That's what you get
for running over my dad!

03:01.360 --> 03:03.000
-Xiaohe.
-How dare you!

03:03.080 --> 03:04.960
-Xiaohe.
-How dare you!

03:05.840 --> 03:07.280
-Quick.
-Dad!

03:07.360 --> 03:08.280
Dad!

03:09.040 --> 03:11.240
Dad! Wake up!

03:11.320 --> 03:13.320
Don't sleep. Dad!

03:13.400 --> 03:14.920
Wake up.

03:15.680 --> 03:18.520
Wake up, Dad! Dad!

03:23.320 --> 03:24.360
Xiaohe.

03:25.320 --> 03:26.600
I'm fine.

03:28.120 --> 03:30.560
Am I rocking it

03:31.080 --> 03:32.920
today?

03:40.400 --> 03:41.600
-Wake up, Dad!
-Sir!

03:41.680 --> 03:43.840
Don't sleep!

03:43.920 --> 03:44.960
Sir.

03:45.720 --> 03:47.640
-Quick. Call an ambulance.
-Okay.

03:48.360 --> 03:49.200
Sir!

03:50.040 --> 03:51.120
Hurry. Drag him out. Quick.

03:52.480 --> 03:53.640
Sir!

03:53.720 --> 03:55.960
-Wake up! Don't sleep, sir!
-How is he?

03:56.960 --> 03:57.920
His bones are fine.

03:58.000 --> 04:00.320
Sir. Sir. Don't sleep.

04:00.400 --> 04:02.240
Mei said there was a roadblock
on the highway.

04:02.320 --> 04:04.360
Turn left at the next intersection.
There's a workshop.

04:04.440 --> 04:05.400
He'll be waiting for us there.

04:05.480 --> 04:06.440
Uncle Ran.

04:07.040 --> 04:08.440
The human traffickers are there.

04:10.800 --> 04:11.720
HOMELY WORKSHOP

04:26.160 --> 04:28.320
AHAO AUTO MAINTENANCE

04:28.400 --> 04:29.480
POLICE

04:49.200 --> 04:50.320
Qu.

05:38.280 --> 05:40.040
This is the only construction area

05:40.120 --> 05:41.280
within all three schools.

05:42.240 --> 05:44.440
Only this spot
doesn't have security cameras.

05:51.520 --> 05:52.760
Let's get to work.

06:00.880 --> 06:02.520
Mister, I need your help.

06:02.600 --> 06:04.080
Have you seen these kids?

06:04.160 --> 06:06.680
Do you know anyone here who gives rides?

06:06.760 --> 06:07.640
No.

06:08.240 --> 06:09.280
Have you seen these kids?

06:09.360 --> 06:10.480
Have you seen these kids?

06:10.560 --> 06:12.840
-Have you seen these five kids?
-No.

06:19.400 --> 06:20.440
I don't know them.

06:21.240 --> 06:22.800
I don't have a car.

06:22.880 --> 06:25.480
I always use a trolley to restock.

06:26.720 --> 06:27.880
All right then.

06:29.960 --> 06:31.280
Wait.

06:31.360 --> 06:34.360
Someone who gives rides?
You can ask that shop.

06:34.440 --> 06:36.560
The owner loves to give people rides

06:36.640 --> 06:39.000
when he restocks.

06:39.080 --> 06:40.400
He is quite scary-looking.

06:40.480 --> 06:44.120
I heard that he was imprisoned once
for kidnapping.

06:45.080 --> 06:46.280
Gaoyishou?

06:52.960 --> 06:54.720
The chef is on a break.

06:54.800 --> 06:56.280
We open at five.

06:56.360 --> 06:57.600
Where is your boss?

06:59.600 --> 07:01.720
We're from the Nanshan Branch.
We're asking about people giving rides.

07:07.200 --> 07:09.840
He went home to sleep.
Please return at 4:30 p.m.

07:22.880 --> 07:24.000
Stand right there!

07:26.840 --> 07:28.760
It hurts! Madam. Not so rough.

07:28.840 --> 07:30.360
It hurts!

07:30.440 --> 07:31.560
Not so rough.

07:31.640 --> 07:33.400
Not so rough. It hurts.

07:33.480 --> 07:34.920
PROSPEROUS BUSINESS

07:36.240 --> 07:38.320
I've never given kids a ride.

07:38.840 --> 07:41.400
You can check the dashcam in my car.

07:42.000 --> 07:44.200
What's with your criminal record
of kidnapping?

07:44.840 --> 07:45.960
Who told you that?

07:47.360 --> 07:48.520
Was it the woman from--

07:48.600 --> 07:50.640
Just answer my question.

07:52.120 --> 07:53.560
I already served my sentence.

07:53.640 --> 07:55.120
What more do you want?

07:56.840 --> 07:57.840
Fine.

07:59.240 --> 08:00.360
It was an argument with my wife.

08:01.200 --> 08:02.040
My wife…

08:02.880 --> 08:04.720
Well, my ex-wife

08:04.800 --> 08:06.280
returned to her parents' place
to hide from me.

08:06.360 --> 08:07.800
I was mad,

08:07.880 --> 08:09.880
so I kidnapped her and starved her.

08:10.400 --> 08:11.720
I was jailed for three years.

08:12.760 --> 08:13.800
Mr. Officer.

08:14.720 --> 08:16.720
I give people rides
when I'm out restocking.

08:16.800 --> 08:18.320
Is that a crime?

08:18.400 --> 08:20.680
Do you have to pin me down and arrest me?

08:20.760 --> 08:22.440
Why did you run just now?

08:24.520 --> 08:25.800
I was arrested once.

08:26.320 --> 08:27.480
Whenever I see police officers,

08:27.560 --> 08:31.040
my legs begin moving before I know it.

08:31.560 --> 08:32.600
Dad.

08:35.840 --> 08:37.000
What?

08:39.640 --> 08:41.840
Isn't she the host on the TV channel?

08:43.320 --> 08:44.680
That's him.

08:46.360 --> 08:48.520
I can recognize him,
even if he has turned into ashes.

08:56.120 --> 08:56.960
Mei.

08:58.320 --> 08:59.360
He's still in Weiyang.

09:12.160 --> 09:13.600
Why aren't they picking up?

09:20.920 --> 09:21.800
Hello, Officer He?

09:21.880 --> 09:22.880
Hey, Ms. Wang.

09:22.960 --> 09:24.640
Can you check if there are
needlestick injuries on Han Zi'ang?

09:39.560 --> 09:41.400
Officer He. I found some.

09:41.480 --> 09:44.800
I found two on his right arm.

09:50.080 --> 09:52.960
Mei is a regular
among the wanted criminals.

09:53.560 --> 09:55.200
He is involved
in many child trafficking cases.

09:55.280 --> 09:57.760
He is cunning and good
at disguising himself.

09:57.840 --> 10:00.440
He has not been arrested
for more than a decade.

10:00.520 --> 10:02.320
Based on the information given
by Officer He Xiaohe,

10:02.400 --> 10:03.480
we can deduce

10:03.560 --> 10:05.480
that Mei lurks around

10:05.560 --> 10:07.640
the construction area near Fuxing Street.

10:07.720 --> 10:11.120
He stalks students who skip classes
to hang out at the illegal internet cafe.

10:12.240 --> 10:14.800
Then, he injects them with anesthetics
before kidnapping them.

10:24.920 --> 10:26.880
The last victim, Han Zi'ang,

10:26.960 --> 10:29.040
is quite different
from the four previous victims.

10:29.120 --> 10:32.440
We believe that after Han Zi'ang
left the internet cafe,

10:32.520 --> 10:34.040
he didn't go home.

10:34.120 --> 10:36.440
Instead, he went to the 18th floor

10:36.520 --> 10:39.120
of New York Block
to explore out of curiosity.

11:02.400 --> 11:05.240
Help! Help! Help!

11:06.520 --> 11:08.600
Help! Help!

11:11.520 --> 11:12.600
After Han Zi'ang,

11:12.680 --> 11:13.960
there has been no new victim.

11:14.040 --> 11:15.000
PERSON OF INTEREST: MEI

11:15.080 --> 11:18.200
That means Han Zi'ang's escape
disrupted Mei's plan.

11:18.280 --> 11:20.680
He had no choice but to stop.
His priority now

11:20.760 --> 11:23.280
is to bring those four victims
out of Weiyang.

11:23.360 --> 11:25.640
Bai, Hui. Print out the wanted posters.

11:25.720 --> 11:27.600
Make sure the photo is huge.

11:27.680 --> 11:29.480
Then, let others post them everywhere.

11:29.560 --> 11:31.840
Xing. Investigate
all egresses of the city.

11:31.920 --> 11:33.040
Check the cameras of bus stations
and train stations

11:33.120 --> 11:34.000
to see if the culprit

11:34.080 --> 11:35.680
-has left Weiyang with the victims.
-Got it.

11:35.760 --> 11:38.560
Mangkun. Bring some men with you
and investigate the motels, hostels,

11:38.640 --> 11:40.400
or warehouses of the district.

11:40.480 --> 11:42.600
The culprit might be hiding
the victims there

11:42.680 --> 11:43.640
before buyers appear.

11:43.720 --> 11:45.040
Guys. Split up.

11:52.760 --> 11:53.600
Xiaohe,

11:53.680 --> 11:55.320
you provided a useful lead.

11:55.400 --> 11:57.920
I allow you to work
with the Special Task Force.

11:58.000 --> 11:59.280
Thank you, sir.

11:59.360 --> 12:01.520
But given the urgency,
is casting your net wide

12:01.600 --> 12:02.960
the best way to do it?

12:03.600 --> 12:05.800
If not, we wait for Mei
to turn himself in?

12:05.880 --> 12:07.000
-But… But we are running out--
-Sorry. Captain Qu.

12:07.080 --> 12:09.400
Xiaohe. Let's go.

12:09.480 --> 12:10.640
Why?

12:21.080 --> 12:22.960
Your deposition was excellent.

12:23.040 --> 12:25.320
And your dad is almost recovered.

12:35.960 --> 12:37.360
Xiaohe,

12:38.760 --> 12:40.080
I owe you an apology.

12:40.720 --> 12:42.480
It was my fault.

12:42.560 --> 12:43.680
I was too harsh on you.

12:43.760 --> 12:46.480
If I had put myself in your shoes,

12:47.000 --> 12:49.320
things wouldn't have ended this way.

12:49.840 --> 12:51.280
You wouldn't have run into danger.

12:54.800 --> 12:56.320
I ask for your forgiveness.

12:57.760 --> 12:58.760
No need to apologize.

13:01.280 --> 13:03.000
I made this mess.

13:05.000 --> 13:07.160
And I will own up.

13:13.960 --> 13:15.200
You have no idea

13:15.280 --> 13:18.320
how worried your dad was
when he heard that you were in danger.

13:18.920 --> 13:21.440
He hailed a cab overnight at Mount Wu
and traveled over 400 kilometers here.

13:21.520 --> 13:22.360
I know.

13:26.800 --> 13:28.600
When he stood before the van,

13:29.360 --> 13:30.720
I already knew it.

13:31.840 --> 13:32.920
Xiaohe.

13:33.800 --> 13:35.080
It's okay, Uncle Ran.

13:36.840 --> 13:37.840
Don't worry about me.

13:37.920 --> 13:40.040
And no need to console me.

13:40.120 --> 13:41.640
I'm strong.

13:44.720 --> 13:47.200
Anyway, what happened
to Melon and the rest?

13:48.320 --> 13:49.360
Who?

13:49.440 --> 13:51.280
Those four guys on the esports team.

13:51.800 --> 13:53.760
After you raided the internet cafe,

13:54.280 --> 13:56.160
are they homeless now?

14:07.680 --> 14:08.960
Aren't we heading home?

14:28.360 --> 14:29.560
Eat slowly.

14:32.040 --> 14:34.000
Oh. Have you found a new base?

14:42.240 --> 14:44.200
We have been thinking a lot lately.

14:44.800 --> 14:46.680
There is no future in esports.

14:46.760 --> 14:47.680
It's better to go back home.

14:47.760 --> 14:50.080
We plan to work

14:50.680 --> 14:52.160
in a factory after the Chinese New Year.

14:55.160 --> 14:57.560
Who says there's no future in esports?

15:01.080 --> 15:03.000
It's the 21st century.

15:03.080 --> 15:04.880
As long as you work with computers,

15:04.960 --> 15:06.280
you have a future.

15:06.880 --> 15:10.440
Besides, all of you have worked
and trained so hard.

15:10.520 --> 15:12.200
If you don't have a match
with someone else,

15:12.280 --> 15:13.720
you'll bring shame to your own hard work.

15:13.800 --> 15:14.920
Exactly.

15:15.000 --> 15:16.400
What about the eggs I bought you guys?

15:19.640 --> 15:22.400
I know several cheap
and legit internet cafes.

15:22.480 --> 15:24.960
All of you will go to the police station
to get your identity cards done

15:25.040 --> 15:26.120
to prove that you're adults.

15:26.200 --> 15:27.800
Then, you can practice there.

15:34.360 --> 15:35.200
Here.

15:44.520 --> 15:47.680
Consider this an investment from me.

15:47.760 --> 15:49.320
Once you become popular,

15:49.400 --> 15:51.040
visit the Criminal Department
and pay me back.

15:53.760 --> 15:55.960
Thank you, Officer Ran.

15:56.840 --> 15:57.880
Dig in.

16:09.240 --> 16:11.160
Come. An extra braised egg for you.

16:12.160 --> 16:14.000
You're awesome, Uncle Ran.

16:14.080 --> 16:15.680
You're my idol for life.

16:15.760 --> 16:17.120
I'm so proud of you.

16:17.200 --> 16:18.680
Another chicken drumstick for you.

16:49.280 --> 16:50.200
What?

16:50.800 --> 16:53.080
Is my cholesterol not high enough?

16:54.400 --> 16:55.520
Forget it then.

16:56.360 --> 16:58.440
You can't put food
in my bowl and take it away.

17:08.319 --> 17:09.560
Uncle Ran,

17:10.079 --> 17:12.880
Melon and the guys
are ambitious, aren't they?

17:14.520 --> 17:15.880
They are good kids.

17:15.960 --> 17:17.800
They work hard and are committed.

17:17.880 --> 17:20.599
Why else did I give them
two months of my salary?

17:20.680 --> 17:21.640
Then,

17:22.400 --> 17:25.720
perhaps you should
support my dream as well.

17:26.240 --> 17:27.880
I want to study music in Beijing.

17:27.960 --> 17:29.920
I work hard and am committed.

17:30.000 --> 17:31.800
Music is not a proper job.

17:31.880 --> 17:34.120
Your priority now is to study

17:34.640 --> 17:36.240
and get into a good university.

17:38.120 --> 17:40.080
You were brave and smart inside the van

17:40.160 --> 17:41.560
with the human traffickers.

17:41.640 --> 17:43.400
You can be a criminal police officer.

17:43.480 --> 17:47.480
Do you want to join the police force
and make use of your talent?

17:49.360 --> 17:50.680
Actually,

17:50.760 --> 17:53.760
being an officer like you sounds cool.

17:55.920 --> 17:56.760
You

17:57.280 --> 18:00.280
will never be an excellent cop like Ran.

18:00.360 --> 18:01.880
Excuse me?

18:01.960 --> 18:03.440
I am just as smart as him,

18:03.520 --> 18:04.600
and I'm stronger than him.

18:06.720 --> 18:10.920
You can have your opinion.
I won't stop you.

18:11.000 --> 18:12.120
Just promise me

18:12.200 --> 18:13.520
that you'll study hard.

18:13.600 --> 18:15.240
After you graduate from high school,

18:15.320 --> 18:16.560
I'll send you to Beijing to study music.

18:17.360 --> 18:18.480
Why not after middle school?

18:18.560 --> 18:19.880
You have to graduate first.

18:20.480 --> 18:21.840
Be a literate rock artist.

18:21.920 --> 18:22.760
He's right.

18:22.840 --> 18:25.160
Don't just rock and roll.

18:26.240 --> 18:28.840
-Deal.
-Deal.

18:30.400 --> 18:31.200
We don't do that anymore.

18:38.840 --> 18:40.080
Deal.

18:40.160 --> 18:41.800
I will study now then.

18:47.040 --> 18:48.440
She is skipping her meal.

18:56.240 --> 18:57.600
Sir.

18:59.360 --> 19:00.640
Xiaohe wrote this song.

19:01.320 --> 19:03.920
Listen to it when you're free.
I think she's good.

19:04.000 --> 19:05.520
-Really?
-Yes.

19:10.320 --> 19:11.440
RESTRICTED AREA

19:16.640 --> 19:17.720
Let's have a drink.

19:19.720 --> 19:20.680
Sir.

19:21.200 --> 19:23.560
Your body hasn't recovered.
The doctor said you shouldn't drink.

19:24.600 --> 19:26.720
For this occasion, we must.

19:39.280 --> 19:40.800
Without you,

19:42.720 --> 19:44.560
my family would be all gone.

19:45.960 --> 19:49.400
I would be all alone for real.

19:50.120 --> 19:51.200
Thank you.

19:53.760 --> 19:56.520
Back then in the hospital,
you told me not to be sappy.

19:57.040 --> 19:58.640
Look who's being sappy now.

20:00.360 --> 20:01.440
Right.

20:07.840 --> 20:09.040
Oh, sir.

20:09.120 --> 20:11.800
Did you find anything useful on your trip?

20:16.040 --> 20:17.400
I told you not to drink,
but you wouldn't listen.

20:18.000 --> 20:19.480
Have some water.

20:24.600 --> 20:25.680
Sir,

20:26.640 --> 20:29.560
I'll request the higher-ups
to give you a longer break.

20:34.400 --> 20:36.880
HE YUANHANG, SECOND-CLASS MERIT

20:40.000 --> 20:41.480
I can't take my wage
without working for it.

20:43.120 --> 20:44.560
I want to give it one last shot

20:45.320 --> 20:47.040
and investigate Yuanlongli again.

20:49.320 --> 20:50.800
Even if I find nothing in the end,

20:52.160 --> 20:55.360
at the very least, I can close
the chapter once and for all.

21:10.480 --> 21:12.000
MISSING PERSON TURNED INTO KIDNAP

21:12.080 --> 21:13.560
FOUR TEENAGERS STILL MISSING

21:15.280 --> 21:16.600
ARE THE POLICE USELESS?

21:16.680 --> 21:17.960
ARE THEY DEAD OR ALIVE?

21:24.840 --> 21:26.480
How many days till the deadline?

21:35.960 --> 21:37.720
Captain Qu. Permission
to assign several policemen

21:37.800 --> 21:39.240
to assist me.

21:39.320 --> 21:41.320
I want to give it my last shot.

21:41.400 --> 21:42.400
Captain Qu.

21:42.920 --> 21:45.040
I'd like to work with Xiaohe.

21:46.240 --> 21:48.120
I want to work with Xiaohe too.

21:51.760 --> 21:53.920
He is the support I found for us.

21:54.000 --> 21:56.360
Old He, help us show them
what we're capable of.

21:58.320 --> 22:00.240
Old He?

22:00.320 --> 22:02.240
Who are you calling old here?

22:02.320 --> 22:03.560
Sorry.

22:03.640 --> 22:06.840
Perhaps we should just call you Mr. He.

22:06.920 --> 22:08.320
-Say it.
-Mr. He.

22:08.920 --> 22:10.000
That's nice.

22:10.080 --> 22:11.320
Mr. He,

22:11.400 --> 22:12.720
how will we investigate Yuanlongli?

22:12.800 --> 22:15.920
Mei is involved in many abduction cases.

22:16.000 --> 22:18.280
He is cunning and good at disguising.

22:18.360 --> 22:21.880
We cannot predict what he will do
by using a logical mind.

22:22.480 --> 22:23.760
For a serial abductor,

22:23.840 --> 22:27.760
the most dangerous place
is the safest place.

22:27.840 --> 22:30.320
That's how they hide under our noses.

22:30.400 --> 22:32.720
Dad. Just cut to the chase.

22:32.800 --> 22:35.920
Yuanlongli will be redeveloped soon.

22:36.000 --> 22:37.840
Many residents have moved away.

22:37.920 --> 22:39.960
All those empty units

22:40.040 --> 22:43.880
are the perfect hiding spot for Mei.

22:44.600 --> 22:46.800
Dad, how come you are so sure

22:46.880 --> 22:48.520
that Mei will be hiding under our noses?

22:48.600 --> 22:49.480
I'm not sure.

22:50.480 --> 22:54.360
But I have a feeling
that there's something more

22:55.360 --> 22:57.000
hiding in Yuanlongli.

23:20.880 --> 23:23.520
Officer He, you came to work again.

23:25.880 --> 23:28.720
Ma Qiang. Fire safety
is very important during winter.

23:28.800 --> 23:29.960
-All of you…
-Officer He.

23:30.040 --> 23:31.240
Officer He, you're here again.

23:33.240 --> 23:35.600
Honestly though, he has worked
as a policeman for so long.

23:35.680 --> 23:37.880
He finally cracked a big case

23:37.960 --> 23:39.120
and got a Second-Class Merit.

23:39.200 --> 23:40.800
Also, it was Officer Ran
who let him claim the credit.

23:41.480 --> 23:44.000
I also heard that his health is bad.

23:44.080 --> 23:45.600
He is claiming disability aid now.

23:46.920 --> 23:49.200
Wasn't the case closed already?

23:49.280 --> 23:51.040
Why is he still in Yuanlongli?

23:52.280 --> 23:53.680
He can't move on.

23:53.760 --> 23:55.880
He needs to feel useful.

24:10.760 --> 24:12.680
Go. Carry it. Quick.

24:13.800 --> 24:15.560
You two. It's good enough.

24:15.640 --> 24:16.960
Good enough. Hurry up now.

24:17.960 --> 24:19.200
Hurry up.

25:19.800 --> 25:21.000
Oh my!

25:22.120 --> 25:23.240
Officer He.

25:24.320 --> 25:25.360
What are you doing here?

25:29.040 --> 25:31.080
I'm here to look for leads.

25:31.160 --> 25:34.040
Give me the keys to the management office
of New York Block.

25:36.640 --> 25:38.640
The keys…

25:41.160 --> 25:43.040
Follow me to the office.

25:44.120 --> 25:45.440
Come.

25:52.800 --> 25:53.760
Officer He.

25:54.800 --> 25:56.080
The keys?

25:56.920 --> 25:57.920
What did you do?

26:00.080 --> 26:03.480
I… We are building a cement block.

26:08.440 --> 26:09.520
Seriously?

26:10.120 --> 26:11.400
A cement block here?

26:11.480 --> 26:13.360
Many people walk here. It's inconvenient.

26:13.440 --> 26:15.120
I'm trying to be considerate.

26:15.200 --> 26:17.960
The workers push
their wheelbarrows around.

26:18.040 --> 26:19.840
A barricade here

26:19.920 --> 26:22.840
can remind them not to hit anyone.

26:30.760 --> 26:32.040
The keys.

26:34.960 --> 26:36.080
Let's go.

26:36.160 --> 26:41.680
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY
BUREAU NANSHAN BRANCH

26:47.160 --> 26:48.280
POLICE BY THE PEOPLE
FOR THE PEOPLE

26:48.360 --> 26:49.280
I was looking for you, Fangxu.

26:49.360 --> 26:51.200
Mei's accomplices confessed everything.

26:51.280 --> 26:52.640
But they do not know where his base is.

26:52.720 --> 26:53.960
Their communication
has always been unilateral.

26:56.640 --> 26:58.280
Grab a screenshot
from the internet cafe's footage.

26:58.360 --> 26:59.720
Then, update Mei's photo

26:59.800 --> 27:00.720
-in our internal system.
-Okay.

27:02.600 --> 27:04.360
Madam. Madam. Madam.

27:04.960 --> 27:06.000
I'm looking for the criminal police.

27:06.080 --> 27:06.920
What's the matter?

27:07.000 --> 27:07.960
I want to report a case.

27:08.040 --> 27:10.000
Come. Let's get you registered first.

27:10.080 --> 27:11.840
It's urgent. I need to report a case.

27:11.920 --> 27:13.040
Wu.

27:13.760 --> 27:15.280
-Captain Ran.
-Madam.

27:15.360 --> 27:16.680
Why are you looking
for the criminal police?

27:16.760 --> 27:18.080
I want to report a case.

27:18.160 --> 27:19.160
A murder in Yuanlongli.

27:32.480 --> 27:33.960
This place is foul.

27:34.040 --> 27:36.120
I rented this place for three years,

27:36.200 --> 27:38.440
and I had to pay for so many things.

27:38.520 --> 27:39.520
Buddy,

27:39.600 --> 27:40.680
are you looking for a place to stay?

27:40.760 --> 27:42.200
Run away now.

27:42.280 --> 27:43.840
This place only has bad luck.

27:43.920 --> 27:45.000
It's haunted.

27:45.080 --> 27:46.600
Just run. Save yourself.

27:46.680 --> 27:48.360
Whoever stays here is cursed.

27:58.640 --> 28:01.240
HUAINAN TEMPLE

28:17.720 --> 28:19.280
Mister,

28:19.360 --> 28:21.320
you seem troubled.

28:21.400 --> 28:23.480
Allow me to draw you

28:23.560 --> 28:25.400
an evil-cleansing talisman.

28:25.480 --> 28:26.640
Come.

28:27.640 --> 28:28.840
Come.

28:31.440 --> 28:33.240
Don't be so rough. Please.

28:33.320 --> 28:35.120
-Don't be so rough.
-Spread superstitions again

28:35.200 --> 28:37.160
-and I will arrest you.
-Don't be so rough.

28:37.240 --> 28:39.240
Don't be so rough.

28:39.320 --> 28:40.480
RAN

28:40.560 --> 28:41.800
-Don't be so rough.
-Shut up.

28:43.640 --> 28:45.280
-Sir.
-It hurts.

28:45.360 --> 28:46.200
Where are you?

28:46.280 --> 28:47.640
Where else can I be?

28:47.720 --> 28:49.080
Come back to the station.

28:49.600 --> 28:51.000
Let me investigate the floor first.

28:51.080 --> 28:52.520
No need.

28:52.600 --> 28:55.320
We may no longer need to visit Yuanlongli.

29:01.200 --> 29:02.120
I'm not scared.

29:02.720 --> 29:03.800
I have money.

29:03.880 --> 29:05.640
I can kill many people,
and others will take the blame for me.

29:05.720 --> 29:06.560
You can't do anything.

29:06.640 --> 29:08.640
You can't do anything to me!

29:09.360 --> 29:11.720
You have two options.

29:11.800 --> 29:13.600
One, I'll burn the photos,

29:13.680 --> 29:15.440
and you'll go somewhere to lay low.

29:15.520 --> 29:16.400
Two,

29:16.480 --> 29:19.120
I'll send the photos and the recording
to the police.

29:19.640 --> 29:22.160
Do you want your freedom and money?

29:22.240 --> 29:23.320
It's your choice.

29:27.280 --> 29:30.560
Director Li of Dongshan Mine
killed himself inside the police station

29:30.640 --> 29:31.680
five years ago.

29:31.760 --> 29:33.560
Today, his surviving wife
came to report a case.

29:33.640 --> 29:36.760
She claimed to have found
Director Li's hidden photos

29:36.840 --> 29:38.800
and recordings when she was moving out.

29:39.400 --> 29:43.440
This suggests Director Li
coerced Song Qingsong into leaving.

29:43.520 --> 29:46.320
But how did Director Li get these photos?

29:46.920 --> 29:49.880
Only two people had the opportunity
to give Director Li the photos.

29:50.720 --> 29:52.360
Cripple Du. Wu Shanlong.

29:52.440 --> 29:54.360
I'm inclined to believe
it was Wu Shanlong.

29:54.440 --> 29:55.720
After all, he stood to profit the most

29:55.800 --> 29:57.760
after Song Qingsong left.

29:57.840 --> 30:00.040
We also found a photocopy
of the tender document

30:00.120 --> 30:02.560
inside Wu Shanlong's home.

30:02.640 --> 30:04.680
While he refused to admit
that he kept the document,

30:05.200 --> 30:07.120
it doesn't mean
that he didn't use the photocopy

30:07.200 --> 30:09.000
to blackmail Song Qingsong.

30:10.040 --> 30:10.880
I even suspect

30:10.960 --> 30:13.760
that the blackmailing letter
written to Song Qingsong by Xu Meng

30:13.840 --> 30:14.960
was forged by him.

30:17.520 --> 30:20.120
Song Qingsong never would have thought

30:20.200 --> 30:22.880
that his brother-in-law was the one
who sabotaged him.

30:27.400 --> 30:30.760
Unfortunately, she failed to escape.

30:39.960 --> 30:42.560
The main culprit, Wu Shanlong, is dead.

30:43.160 --> 30:44.880
The one who hired a hitman, Song Qingsong,

30:44.960 --> 30:46.920
fled abroad for many years.

30:48.520 --> 30:51.760
All we can do now
is to release a wanted poster.

30:54.000 --> 30:55.440
But I don't understand one thing.

30:56.760 --> 30:59.520
Wu Shanlong isn't smart.

31:01.200 --> 31:03.560
How could he devise so many plans?

31:19.200 --> 31:21.000
Ms. Zhao, you're out.

31:21.080 --> 31:23.120
Ms. Zhao, you look so beautiful.

31:23.200 --> 31:25.400
After our new treatment,

31:25.480 --> 31:26.880
you look younger and prettier.

31:28.120 --> 31:30.560
I have solid genes. My heels.

31:30.640 --> 31:32.840
XINXIN BEAUTY SALON

31:32.920 --> 31:35.120
Young girls like you

31:35.200 --> 31:37.320
shouldn't just chase
after physical beauty blindly.

31:37.400 --> 31:40.120
A woman's real charisma
doesn't come from her face,

31:40.760 --> 31:41.880
but here.

31:44.400 --> 31:48.000
Ms. Zhao. The balance
on your membership card is running low.

31:48.080 --> 31:49.640
Do you want to…

31:52.320 --> 31:53.120
Top up another 10,000 yuan.

31:53.200 --> 31:56.800
How generous of you, Ms. Zhao.

31:57.320 --> 31:58.720
Men are unreliable.

31:59.400 --> 32:01.080
As women, we should treat ourselves.

32:01.160 --> 32:02.000
See you.

32:02.800 --> 32:04.400
Bye, Ms. Zhao.

32:04.480 --> 32:05.600
Come back again.

32:05.680 --> 32:07.040
Drive safely.

32:08.760 --> 32:09.920
I'm so sick of her.

32:10.000 --> 32:11.080
Listen.

32:11.160 --> 32:13.640
She used to open
a foot massage parlor too.

32:13.720 --> 32:15.760
She found a guy called Wu Shanlong,

32:15.840 --> 32:18.160
and they both took over a cement factory.

32:18.240 --> 32:20.200
That's how she became rich.

32:20.280 --> 32:22.240
-Is that so?
-Yes.

32:23.480 --> 32:25.000
So, she still relied on a man in the end.

33:06.040 --> 33:09.080
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

33:19.400 --> 33:22.160
Ma Qiang. Give me the list of Yuanlongli's
current residents and tenants.

33:22.240 --> 33:23.280
Several copies of it.

33:23.360 --> 33:25.840
Officer He, what is this for?

33:25.920 --> 33:27.240
Just do what you're told.

33:33.040 --> 33:34.640
How many units have been vacated?

33:34.720 --> 33:35.920
Many.

33:36.000 --> 33:37.680
They are marked in red there.

33:38.960 --> 33:40.320
2015 YUANLONGLI PROPERTY
OWNER/TENANT ROSTER

33:40.400 --> 33:41.680
It seems like we have a busy night ahead.

33:41.760 --> 33:43.160
Let's split up.

33:43.240 --> 33:46.000
Zheng Zhong, you, Bai, and Hui
are in charge of Floors 1 to 9.

33:46.080 --> 33:47.480
Xiaohe and I will check the ones upstairs.

33:47.560 --> 33:49.400
Use the walkie-talkie
if you find anything.

33:49.480 --> 33:50.480
Understood.

34:03.240 --> 34:06.440
DEMOLITION

34:20.120 --> 34:21.920
The vacant units on the eastern side
of the 4th floor

34:22.000 --> 34:23.040
are 13 and 16.

34:23.719 --> 34:24.560
Let's check 13 first.

35:56.640 --> 35:58.440
It hurts! Be gentle. It hurts!

35:58.520 --> 35:59.840
Shut up!

36:12.880 --> 36:14.440
An escape room?

36:14.960 --> 36:17.880
Do you even have the license for it?

36:18.800 --> 36:20.240
It's so late at night.

36:20.320 --> 36:22.600
You're doing this instead of sleeping.

36:22.680 --> 36:25.000
This is a nuisance, do you hear me?

36:25.840 --> 36:27.120
Sorry, sir.

36:27.200 --> 36:28.280
We've made a mistake.

36:28.360 --> 36:29.480
We've made a mistake.

36:29.560 --> 36:30.440
We'll leave now.

36:30.520 --> 36:31.760
-Now.
-Go.

36:31.840 --> 36:32.880
Sorry, sir.

36:32.960 --> 36:34.440
Sorry. Sorry.

36:38.640 --> 36:39.960
Mr. He. Mr. He.

36:40.560 --> 36:42.920
We've searched all nine floors.
Nothing unusual.

36:44.840 --> 36:46.120
Copy.

36:50.960 --> 36:53.080
RESIDENTS
TENANTS REGISTRATION FORM

36:54.960 --> 36:56.880
RESIDENT, TENANT, RESIDENT

36:58.760 --> 37:01.600
Dad, Mei loves to use a fake identity.

37:01.680 --> 37:03.600
He can rent a place using a fake identity.

37:04.360 --> 37:05.840
How many tenants are here?

37:20.960 --> 37:22.280
HE YIQIANG

37:23.840 --> 37:24.800
HAO YOUQIANG

37:25.360 --> 37:29.240
QIANG WEI'AN, WU QIANGYI, WANG ZIQIANG

37:30.960 --> 37:32.160
Check this one first.

37:33.280 --> 37:34.360
HE YIQIANG

37:34.440 --> 37:35.480
Why?

37:35.560 --> 37:38.040
Mei's fake identities
always have three characters.

37:38.120 --> 37:40.080
And it always contains Qiang.

37:42.840 --> 37:46.440
1316, ZHAO SONGLI, HE YIQIANG

37:50.040 --> 37:51.840
Bai, Hui, Zheng Zhong.

37:51.920 --> 37:54.160
Regroup at 1316 now. Now.

38:25.960 --> 38:28.040
I'll go to Ma Qiang and call the owner.

38:44.680 --> 38:46.600
Make sure to follow
the emergency break-in protocol later.

38:46.680 --> 38:47.680
Okay.

39:01.400 --> 39:02.440
Dad.
